      <chord name="C"/>There is a <chord name="E7"/>quiet place,<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Far from the <chord name="C7"/>rapid pace where <chord name="F"/>God can <chord name="A7"/>soothe my <chord name="Dm"/>troubled <chord name="Em"/>mind.<br/>
      <chord name="Gm"/>Sheltered by <chord name="C7"/>tree and flow&#x27;r,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>There in my <chord name="Dm"/>quiet hour with <chord name="Am"/>Him my <chord name="F#m"/>cares <chord name="B7"/>are <chord name="E"/>left be<chord name="Dm7"/>hind<chord name="G"/>.<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Whether a <chord name="E7"/>garden small,<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Or on a <chord name="C7"/>mountain tall, New <chord name="F"/>strength and <chord name="E7"/>courage <chord name="Am"/>there I <chord name="C7"/>find;<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Then from this <chord name="Dm7"/>quiet place<br/>
      <chord name="Em7"/>I go pre<chord name="A7"/>pared to face a <chord name="Dm"/>new day With <chord name="G7"/>love for all man<chord name="C"/>kind.
